[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8881.51, "timestamp": "02:28:01", "text": "。 这是。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8882.63, "timestamp": "02:28:02", "text": "你的意思是？ 它不会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8884.63, "timestamp": "02:28:04", "text": "上瘾。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8885.349, "timestamp": "02:28:05", "text": "每个人都……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8887.91, "timestamp": "02:28:07", "text": "我只是……我只是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8889.75, "timestamp": "02:28:09", "text": "我每天早上都玩，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8891.83, "timestamp": "02:28:11", "text": "这很正常。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8892.79, "timestamp": "02:28:12", "text": "休闲玩家。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8896.71, "timestamp": "02:28:16", "text": "我称它为“脑棒”是有原因的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8899.19, "timestamp": "02:28:19", "text": "哇。 你知道吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8902.55, "timestamp": "02:28:22", "text": "当他们推出新的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8905.83, "timestamp": "02:28:25", "text": "稀有度类别时，游戏体验就会变得很糟糕，因为现在只有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8909.59, "timestamp": "02:28:29", "text": "SSR。 等它升级到 LR 或者"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8911.67, "timestamp": "02:28:31", "text": "UL 之类的吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8917.67, "timestamp": "02:28:37", "text": "真正的脑力劳动才刚刚"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8918.95, "timestamp": "02:28:38", "text": "开始。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8921.75, "timestamp": "02:28:41", "text": "而且，我觉得这游戏也就"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8925.429, "timestamp": "02:28:45", "text": "一般般，你知道的。 这就像赌博一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8927.75, "timestamp": "02:28:47", "text": "它是ga。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8931.11, "timestamp": "02:28:51", "text": "不，不。 你看，在佐治亚州，这其实就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8934.389, "timestamp": "02:28:54", "text": "赌博，对吧？ 我冒着"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8939.75, "timestamp": "02:28:59", "text": "。"}]